source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A period ends no token, so Jira shows the first pair and breaks on the second; jiro reads the same.
-- input.jira --
a\\b.c\\d
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\b.c<br class="atl-forced-newline" />d</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\b.c\
d
